# Event Planner

A simple Event Planner web application built using React.js.

The application allows users to create, view, and delete events through a simple and user-friendly interface.

---

## Features

- Add a new event
- Enter event name
- Select event date
- Enter event location
- Add event description
- View all created events
- Delete events
- Responsive user interface

---

## Technologies Used

- React.js
- JavaScript
- HTML
- CSS
- Vite
- Node.js
- npm

